aragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273480/extras/139abc50cbd663b85400ea31c34f2191.poster.avif?t=1782402390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273480/extras/139abc50cbd663b85400ea31c34f2191.webm?t=1782402390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273480/extras/139abc50cbd663b85400ea31c34f2191.mp4?t=1782402390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrivalled immersion</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-body awareness and true-to-life interactions deliver unmatched presence in every moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273480/extras/5b0e7d97558695c3445746823e6372ef.poster.avif?t=1782402390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273480/extras/5b0e7d97558695c3445746823e6372ef.webm?t=1782402390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273480/extras/5b0e7d97558695c3445746823e6372ef.mp4?t=1782402390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase the Deluxe Upgrade at launch to receive the Ferran (dark) and Agent cosmetic sets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273480/extras/3c783cb507b613e944d78bc5db97d0b7.avif?t=1782402390\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste